WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.102 --> 00:00:00.736
Ivanna, thanks so much for

00:00:00.870 --> 00:00:03.739
joining us this morning.

00:00:03.873 --> 00:00:04.273
&gt;&gt; Thank you.

00:00:04.407 --> 00:00:05.675
&gt;&gt;&gt; And joining us now to talk

00:00:05.808 --> 00:00:08.578
about all of this, CNN military

00:00:08.711 --> 00:00:10.813
analyst, retired lieutenant

00:00:10.947 --> 00:00:12.715
general mark hertling.

00:00:12.849 --> 00:00:13.583
Good morning, general.

00:00:13.716 --> 00:00:15.051
I'd like to start by just

00:00:15.484 --> 00:00:16.719
getting your reaction to what we

00:00:16.853 --> 00:00:18.254
heard today from president

00:00:18.387 --> 00:00:18.554
Putin.

00:00:18.688 --> 00:00:21.157
Your reaction to his speech and

00:00:21.490 --> 00:00:22.825
also I think really the big news

00:00:22.959 --> 00:00:23.759
from that speech this morning

00:00:23.893 --> 00:00:25.494
which was that Russia was going

00:00:25.528 --> 00:00:27.597
to be pulling out -- or not

00:00:27.730 --> 00:00:28.898
participating in the new start

00:00:29.031 --> 00:00:31.133
nuclear treaty.

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:33.002
How do you view that bit of news

00:00:33.135 --> 00:00:33.502
in particular?

00:00:33.603 --> 00:00:35.771
Do you view it as more symbolic

00:00:35.905 --> 00:00:38.808
or does it have some real teeth?

00:00:38.941 --> 00:00:41.577
&gt;&gt; Well, yeah, good morning,

00:00:41.711 --> 00:00:43.145
Kristen and Jim.

00:00:43.512 --> 00:00:45.514
I do see it as somewhat symbolic

00:00:45.514 --> 00:00:47.583
but I also see it as Putin

00:00:47.717 --> 00:00:48.384
hurting himself.

00:00:48.517 --> 00:00:50.086
I think he wants to gain more

00:00:50.219 --> 00:00:51.053
intelligence from us than we

00:00:51.187 --> 00:00:52.922
want to gain from him with this

00:00:53.055 --> 00:00:54.991
new start treaty.

00:00:55.124 --> 00:00:58.461
The comment by Fred pleitgen

00:00:58.594 --> 00:00:59.195
earlier about they were

00:00:59.528 --> 00:01:01.130
concerned about how much

00:01:01.530 --> 00:01:03.065
intelligence Ukraine had gained

00:01:03.199 --> 00:01:04.400
from the Engels air force base

00:01:04.533 --> 00:01:07.536
in Russia, which is near Moscow,

00:01:07.536 --> 00:01:09.805
it was just fascinating to me

00:01:09.939 --> 00:01:10.940
because it's basically saying,

00:01:11.073 --> 00:01:12.508
hey, they want to target our

00:01:12.642 --> 00:01:13.876
facilities.

00:01:14.010 --> 00:01:14.543
Of course they do.

00:01:14.677 --> 00:01:17.146
You know, but going back to your

00:01:17.546 --> 00:01:20.249
original question, like Fred

00:01:20.383 --> 00:01:20.983
pleitgen I woke up and watched

00:01:21.117 --> 00:01:22.485
Mr. Putin's speech.

00:01:22.618 --> 00:01:24.420
Besides the new start treaty,

00:01:24.553 --> 00:01:26.522
the comments about pedophilia in

00:01:26.656 --> 00:01:28.491
the west, traitors in Russia

00:01:28.624 --> 00:01:30.526
will be punished, the west

00:01:30.660 --> 00:01:39.035
started the war, the west is

00:01:39.168 --> 00:01:40.703
responsible for Ukrainian

00:01:40.836 --> 00:01:41.103
escalation.

00:01:41.237 --> 00:01:42.138
These are tropes we have been

00:01:42.271 --> 00:01:44.340
had a erring from Mr. Putin all

00:01:44.473 --> 00:01:44.640
along.

00:01:44.774 --> 00:01:46.575
His state of the Russia

00:01:46.709 --> 00:01:48.110
federation, at least he didn't

00:01:48.244 --> 00:01:49.578
have someone standing up and

00:01:49.578 --> 00:01:50.780
yelling liar but he did have a

00:01:50.913 --> 00:01:53.082
lot of sleepy parliamentary

00:01:53.215 --> 00:01:54.917
members and generals in that

00:01:55.051 --> 00:01:55.751
audience because they have heard

00:01:55.885 --> 00:01:56.385
it all before.

00:01:56.519 --> 00:01:58.354
&gt;&gt; Let me ask you, general

00:01:58.487 --> 00:01:59.188
hertling, those are not the

00:01:59.588 --> 00:02:00.122
words of a president who is

00:02:00.256 --> 00:02:02.358
looking to end this war.

00:02:02.491 --> 00:02:05.594
He's digging in and he may have

00:02:05.594 --> 00:02:06.862
China's help going forward.

00:02:06.996 --> 00:02:08.264
There was some hope that maybe

00:02:08.397 --> 00:02:10.399
this was the year that Ukraine

00:02:10.533 --> 00:02:12.802
breaks through those Russian

00:02:12.935 --> 00:02:14.870
lines, takes back territory,

00:02:15.004 --> 00:02:16.872
maybe Russia sues for peace.

00:02:17.006 --> 00:02:19.842
As you hear those words and hear

00:02:19.976 --> 00:02:21.844
China considering stepping in,

00:02:21.978 --> 00:02:22.878
does that hope disappear?

00:02:23.012 --> 00:02:24.213
&gt;&gt; It doesn't, Jim.

00:02:24.347 --> 00:02:25.114
One of the things I didn't

00:02:25.247 --> 00:02:26.549
mention about his speech, he had

00:02:26.682 --> 00:02:29.819
a big section where he vowed to

00:02:29.952 --> 00:02:31.253
systemically press the

00:02:31.620 --> 00:02:32.455
offensive, which tells me he is

00:02:32.588 --> 00:02:34.824
not changing his strategic

00:02:34.957 --> 00:02:39.628
objectives and as you and I have

00:02:39.762 --> 00:02:40.296
talked on several occasions

00:02:40.429 --> 00:02:41.897
those three strategic objectives

00:02:42.031 --> 00:02:43.165
that he had at the beginning of

00:02:43.299 --> 00:02:45.634
the war have failed in every

00:02:45.634 --> 00:02:46.068
single phase of the war.

00:02:46.202 --> 00:02:46.435
&gt;&gt; Yeah.

00:02:46.569 --> 00:02:48.204
&gt;&gt; He has not been able to press

00:02:48.337 --> 00:02:50.373
those, he has shown the

00:02:50.506 --> 00:02:51.640
inability to get his soldiers

00:02:51.640 --> 00:02:52.808
moving on the battlefield and I

00:02:52.942 --> 00:02:54.410
don't think we're going to see

00:02:54.543 --> 00:02:56.879
any more of that other than more

00:02:57.013 --> 00:02:58.647
killing of Russian mobilized

00:02:58.781 --> 00:03:02.852
troops which is going to be

00:03:02.985 --> 00:03:03.252
unfortunate.

00:03:03.652 --> 00:03:05.888
&gt;&gt; Is China --

00:03:06.022 --> 00:03:08.357
&gt;&gt; Go I ahead --

00:03:08.491 --> 00:03:11.660
&gt;&gt; If Russia is incapable of

00:03:11.660 --> 00:03:13.129
gaining territory but digging in

00:03:13.262 --> 00:03:15.765
and going to have help from

00:03:15.898 --> 00:03:17.666
China is it lengthening the

00:03:17.666 --> 00:03:17.733
slog?

00:03:17.867 --> 00:03:20.069
No clear winner but a lot of

00:03:20.202 --> 00:03:22.171
sadly death and destruction on

00:03:22.304 --> 00:03:24.106
the battlefield like we've seen

00:03:24.240 --> 00:03:24.807
so much in recent weeks?

00:03:24.940 --> 00:03:26.108
&gt;&gt; I think what we're going to

00:03:26.242 --> 00:03:27.676
see in the next couple of weeks

00:03:27.743 --> 00:03:30.246
is a rush to victory by both

00:03:30.379 --> 00:03:30.846
sides, if you will.

00:03:30.980 --> 00:03:32.681
Russia is going to continue to

00:03:32.815 --> 00:03:34.850
put more on the front lines but

00:03:34.984 --> 00:03:37.820
they're mobilized untrained

00:03:37.953 --> 00:03:38.554
forces and it will create a slog

00:03:38.687 --> 00:03:41.690
and unfortunately a lot of death

00:03:41.690 --> 00:03:42.725
for Russia soldiers and

00:03:42.858 --> 00:03:43.859
Ukrainians as well, but I think

00:03:43.993 --> 00:03:46.128
Ukraine is attempting to push

00:03:46.262 --> 00:03:47.696
the envelope, get trained in

00:03:47.730 --> 00:03:49.698
Europe, in Germany, Poland, the

00:03:49.732 --> 00:03:51.700
uk, the various places where

00:03:51.801 --> 00:03:54.603
they're training and being able

00:03:54.737 --> 00:03:55.704
to capably execute an offensive.

00:03:55.738 --> 00:03:57.339
I see that happening later in

00:03:57.706 --> 00:03:59.875
the winter, probably early

00:04:00.009 --> 00:04:00.209
spring.

00:04:00.342 --> 00:04:01.710
So we're going to see some back

00:04:01.777 --> 00:04:03.813
and forth for a while, but I do

00:04:03.946 --> 00:04:06.282
believe that Ukraine is going to

00:04:06.415 --> 00:04:07.817
take the fight to the enemy and

00:04:07.950 --> 00:04:09.118
regain much of their territory

00:04:09.251 --> 00:04:11.220
in the spring and early summer.

00:04:11.353 --> 00:04:12.621
&gt;&gt; Goodness.

00:04:12.755 --> 00:04:14.390
It will be a lot to watch in the

00:04:14.523 --> 00:04:15.724
coming weeks because both sides

00:04:15.724 --> 00:04:16.992
seem to be digging in for

00:04:17.126 --> 00:04:19.728
something aggressive.

00:04:19.795 --> 00:04:22.064
Lieutenant colonel mark

